<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka rupee closes at record low versus dollar.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka rupee closes at record low versus dollar.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan rupee closed at a record low of 56.45 to the dollar on import covering on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee reached an all-time low of 56.55 but ended off that level, with help from late dollar profit-taking. This compared with Thursday's close of 56.40.</p>
</text>
